1Co 10:1 , The sacraments of the Jews are types of ours;
1Co 10:7 , and their punishments
1Co 10:11 . examples for us;
1Co 10:13 , We must flee from idolatry;
1Co 10:21 , We must not make the Lord's table the table of devils;
1Co 10:24 , and in things indifferent we must have regard of our brethren.
